# Normalize line endings so content hashes are reproducible.
#
# Why this file exists: `pinned_revisions.json` pins SHA-256 hashes of the
# ablation modules, and those hashes are byte-sensitive. On Windows a default
# `core.autocrlf=true` checkout rewrites LF files to CRLF, which silently
# invalidates every pin while `git status` still reports the tree as clean --
# exactly the drift the pin gate exists to prevent. Pinning the endings here
# makes the gate platform-independent.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary payloads: never translate.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary
*.sql -text
